<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>포인트 샵 - NoteHub</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style/pointshop_style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shop-container">
    <h2 class="shop-title">포인트 샵</h2>

    <div class="point-info">
      안녕하세요, <strong><%= user.user_id %></strong>님<br>
      현재 보유 포인트: <strong><%= user.point %>P</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="item-list">
      <div class="item">
        <h4>컴포즈 기프티콘</h4>
        <p>아이스 아메리카노 1잔 / 300P</p>
        <form action="/pointshop/buy" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="item" value="caffee">
          <button type="submit">구매하기</button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <h4>베스킨라빈스 기프티콘</h4>
        <p>파인트 아이스크림 / 1000P</p>
        <form action="/pointshop/buy" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="item" value="icecream">
          <button type="submit">구매하기</button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <h4>BBQ 기프티킨</h4>
        <p>황올반 + 양념반 + 콜라 1.25L<br>기프티콘 / 2500P</p>
        <form action="/pointshop/buy" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="item" value="chicken">
          <button type="submit">구매하기</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <a href="/">다시 돌아가기</a>
  </div>

  <!-- 알림 메시지 -->
  <% if (alertMessage) { %>
    <script>
      window.onload = function () {
        alert(<%- JSON.stringify(alertMessage) %>);
      }
    </script>
  <% } %>
</body>
</html>